{
  "title": "Kinematics Concept Map",
  "notes": [
    "- Kinematics (Mechanics: statics, kinematics, dynamics)",
    "  - Describing motion",
    "    - Position, displacement, distance",
    "    - Speed (scalar), velocity (vector)",
    "    - Acceleration (change of velocity / time)",
    "  - Graphs",
    "    - x–t → slope = velocity",
    "    - v–t → slope = acceleration, area = displacement",
    "  - Uniform acceleration",
    "    - v = u + at",
    "    - s = ut + ½at²",
    "    - v² = u² + 2as",
    "  - Relative velocity",
    "    - v_AB = v_A − v_B",
    "    - Same direction → subtract; opposite → add",
    "  - Gravity",
    "    - Free fall: v = gt, h = ½gt²",
    "    - Upward throw: H = u²/2g, T = 2u/g",
    "  - Projectile",
    "    - T = 2u sinθ/g",
    "    - H = u² sin²θ/2g",
    "    - R = u² sin2θ/g → max at 45°",
    "    - Path is a parabola"
  ]
}